{"id":"compose-assist-web-ai-prompt-patch-jira-estimate","kind":"compose_assist_prompt_patch","title":"Web AI compose should suggest a prompt patch after the user typed a Jira estimate request","owner":"demo","privacy":"synthetic-redacted","sampleContext":{"collectionMode":"snapshot","seedUserId":"eval-compose-assist-prompt-patch","site":"chatgpt","provider":"chatgpt","composerType":"contenteditable","title":"ChatGPT - Jira estimate analysis","url":"https://chatgpt.com/c/eval-jira-estimate-patch","currentThread":"The user has already typed a prompt asking another AI to analyze Jira ticket estimates. Personal AI should offer a Compose icon that inserts missing context and boundaries, not send the prompt.","draftText":"帮我分析这些 Jira ticket 的 estimate，看看能不能自动生成 Dev/QA 估算。","primaryText":"User is asking an external AI for Jira ticket estimate analysis and wants the output to respect the internal Task Estimate workflow.","visibleMessages":[{"sender":"user","text":"我想让外部 AI 帮忙分析 Jira ticket estimate，但需要按我们自己的口径来。"}],"sourceTypes":["jira","glip","manual","source_memory"],"memories":[{"sourceType":"jira","source":"eval-seed-compose-assist-message","sourceTitle":"Eval seed - Jira estimate prompt patch","scope":"work","privacy":"synthetic-redacted","skipExtraction":true,"content":"Task Estimate workflow memory: evaluate Jira ticket estimates from Jira team field, Summary, Description, Issue type, and Historical Story Points benchmark. AI Service should dry-run or write Google Sheet only, not Jira, and must include missing reason / low confidence reason for unclear tickets."},{"sourceType":"jira","source":"eval-seed-compose-assist-indexed","sourceTitle":"Eval seed - Jira estimate prompt patch","scope":"work","privacy":"synthetic-redacted","content":"Jira estimate prompt patch eval seed. Task Estimate workflow evaluates Jira ticket estimates from Jira team field, Summary, Description, Issue type, and Historical Story Points benchmark. AI Service should dry-run or write Google Sheet only, not Jira, and must include missing reason / low confidence reason for unclear tickets."}]},"manualVerification":{"title":"Web AI prompt patch 手动体验验证","summary":"验证用户输入完整 prompt 并真正离开输入框后出现 Compose icon；hover 只预览最终补丁正文，确认后只追加草稿，不会自动提交给外部 AI。","prerequisites":["启动 memory-service；当前用户需要有 Jira estimate 口径相关记忆，可参考本 case 的 sampleContext.memories 写入 synthetic seed。","运行 npm start，等待 webpack compiled successfully 后刷新本地扩展。","打开 ChatGPT、Claude 或豆包等支持的 Web AI 页面。"],"steps":["在输入框中输入：帮我分析这些 Jira ticket 的 estimate，看看能不能自动生成 Dev/QA 估算。","点击页面安全空白处或按 Tab，让输入框发生一次真实 blur；不要点击 Send/Submit。","等待输入框右上角出现 Personal AI compose icon。","hover compose icon，直接阅读待追加的 prompt patch 正文。","点击 compose icon 进入锁定预览，再点击“追加到 prompt”。"],"expected":["focus/input 期间不请求；真实 blur 后才出现可用的 Compose icon。","hover 和锁定预览只展示待插入正文，不展示来源路由、草稿回执、来源卡片、证据链接或建议依据。","待插入文本包含依据字段、输出列、写回边界、验证、来源处理，以及 Historical Story Points benchmark、missing reason / low confidence reason、不要自动写回 Jira。","第一次点击只锁定预览，不改写输入框；确认后在原 prompt 上追加 patch，原站点不会自动提交或发送。","插入后的短回执显示已追加 prompt 补丁、仍未发送，并提供约 10 秒撤销窗口。"],"cleanup":["停止 npm start 和 memory-service dev server。"],"evidence":["保存 report.html 或截图，包含 compose icon、正文-only 预览、追加后的输入框和未发送/撤销回执。"]},"expectedTopics":["Jira","estimate","team field","Historical Story Points","Google Sheet","missing reason"],"mustNotReturnTopics":["RingCentral email login","Project Orbit"],"minExpectedTopicHits":3,"minEvidenceTopicHits":1,"expectedBehavior":{"assist":"suggest_prompt_patch","suggestionType":"prompt_patch","requiredSections":["依据字段","输出列","写回边界","验证","来源处理"],"mustInclude":["Historical Story Points benchmark","missing reason / low confidence reason","不要自动写回 Jira"],"mustNotInclude":["RingCentral email login","Project Orbit"],"riskLevel":"medium","previewRequired":true}}
